<title>POLAND: Polish BGZ bank to issue $120 mln CPs in London.</title>
<headline>Polish BGZ bank to issue $120 mln CPs in London.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's state-owned Bank Gospodarki Zywnosciowej (BGZ) will issue $120 million of zloty-denominated commercial paper in London before the end of the year, its spokeswoman said on Monday.</p>
<p>Agnieszka Jaworska told Reuters that BGZ's 11-month CPs would be sold in three tranches through a Polish financial institution, but declined to give the name of the agent.  </p>
<p>Jaworska declined to give further details about the issue.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
